flowchart LR
  H[Owned stddef macro] --> P[Parser: typename and member/index path]
  P --> S[Semantic analysis: all index constraints]
  S --> L[Source-point complete target layout]
  L --> C[Integer constant: unsigned long size_t]
  C --> ICE[Bounds, enumerators, cases, static initializers]
  C --> IR[Typed IR const]
  IR --> VM[Independent interpreter]
  IR --> ELF[Original encoded ELF object]
